  # than as `preferred-citation`: the citation handed to users must remain the
  # software itself until the paper exists. Once the paper is accepted, move
  # this entry to a top-level `preferred-citation:` key, drop `status` and
  # `notes`, and add `doi`, `volume`, `issue`, `pages` and `year`.
